sops.workflow:
1. User -> Transportation Planner;
2. Transportation Planner -> Accommodation Planner;
3. Accommodation Planner -> Restaurant Planner;
   Accommodation Planner -> Attractions Planner;
   Accommodation Planner -> Data Validator;
4. Restaurant Planner -> Data Validator;
   Attractions Planner -> Data Validator;
5. Data Validator -> Final Plan Summarizer;
6. Final Plan Summarizer -> End.

Description:
First, the Transportation Planner establishes the closed-loop route and daily cities. Accommodation Planner then books lodging meeting 'entire room' requirements for 5 people. Simultaneously, Accommodation Planner forwards the itinerary to Restaurant and Attractions Planners for parallel meal/activity planning while sending lodging details to Data Validator. All planners (Accommodation, Restaurant, Attractions) must document tool verification logs for every entry. Data Validator rigorously cross-checks all named entities against these logs, replacing invalid entries with '-' plus error notes. Final Plan Summarizer compiles only validated data into the itinerary, enforcing budget and routing constraints.
